# Project Decisions

<!-- PROJECT-DECISIONS-SCHEMA:1 -->

This tracked file is the authoritative, harness-neutral record of durable project
decisions. Codex and Claude read active decisions before substantive work. The
owner's current instruction remains higher authority.

Add decisions only through `.project-decisions/project_decisions.py promote`.
History is append-only: replace or withdraw a decision by adding a new record whose
`supersedes` field names the earlier active decision. Never silently edit history.

The ignored `.project-decisions/outcomes.jsonl` file is non-authoritative working
history. Do not load it routinely; inspect only relevant outcomes when resuming,
promoting, handing over, or auditing work.

